      "id": 1,
      "text": "Hurst earned its name when Uncle Billy struck a deal in 1903 with the Rock Island Railroad, letting them lay tracks and build a depot that bore his name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
